{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38302","headline":"闺情 · 韩偓","name":"闺情","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"轻风滴砾动帘钩，宿酒犹酣嬾卸头。\n但觉夜深花有露，不知人静月当楼。\n何郎烛暗谁能咏，韩寿香焦亦任偷。\n敲折玉钗歌转咽，一声声作两眉愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38302.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38302","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「闺情」条，撰者管遗瑞、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"管遗瑞"}